cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Truly, please cite it as below."
title: "Truly: a privacy-first music recommender"
type: software
authors:
  - alias: hashtagRR
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-19
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/hashtagRR/Truly"
url: "https://hashtagrr.github.io/Truly"
abstract: >-
  Truly is a free, open source, privacy-first music recommender. A listener
  describes their mood and energy, and Truly plays a short path of classical
  music that starts where they are and moves one piece at a time towards
  calmer or brighter, with a reason for every piece. Optional on-device
  camera and voice models only nudge where a path starts. Truly is not
  designed or intended for medical, diagnostic, psychological assessment,
  therapeutic or clinical purposes.
keywords:
  - music recommendation
  - valence and arousal
  - iso principle
  - privacy
  - on-device machine learning
  - knowledge distillation
  - ONNX Runtime Web
